  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e9585b4d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Test case\n",
    "In the following, we show a test case and compare generations **with** and **without** activation steering.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Note**: Users should swap the example configs with their own to show desirable performance. The following is for pipeline illustration only."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "id": "224a58ec",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "test_cases = [\n",
    "    \"Write a dialogue between two people, one is dressed up in a ball gown and the other is dressed down in sweats. The two are going to a nightly event. Your answer must contain exactly 3 bullet points in the markdown format (use \\\"* \\\" to indicate each bullet) such as:\\n* This is the first point.\\n* This is the second point.\",\n",
    "    \"What is the difference between the 13 colonies and the other British colonies in North America? Your answer must contain exactly 6 bullet point in Markdown using the following format:\\n* Bullet point one.\\n* Bullet point two.\\n...\\n* Bullet point fix.\"\n",
    "]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "27e15235-d94c-4a6c-a034-ead96db6ffdb",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Before we start, we define the sampling parameters:\n",
    "\n",
    "**Note**: token 32007 is phi-specific, refer to the original huggingface implementation for details https://github.com/microsoft/llm-steer-instruct/blob/main/utils/generation_utils.py.\n",
    "\n",
    "- Option 1: we can use a uniform sampling parameters as follows"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 7,
   "id": "c236878d-de6d-410b-90d4-56c408eb8bd7",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# sampling_params = SamplingParams(\n",
    "#     temperature=0.0,                       \n",
    "#     max_tokens=2048,\n",
    "#     stop_token_ids=[llm.tokenizer.eos_token_id, 32007],  \n",
    "# )"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2b02da22-ea1d-40c0-98a0-8a72eb55c264",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "- Option 2: we can vary the steering settings per request by passing a list of `SamplingParams` aligned with the prompts. Each entry's `extra_args[\"steer\"]` carries the full steering config for that request, so different prompts in the **same batch** can use different coefficients, methods, optimal layers, etc. Below, the first prompt uses the JSON config as-is, while the second prompt overrides `method` and `coefficient` (everything else inherited from the JSON config)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "id": "02ca9272",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "base_steer = config[\"steering\"]  # full default config from the JSON\n",
    "\n",
    "sampling_params_list = [\n",
    "    SamplingParams(\n",
    "        temperature=0.0,\n",
    "        max_tokens=2048,\n",
    "        stop_token_ids=[llm.tokenizer.eos_token_id, 32007],\n",
    "    ),\n",
    "    SamplingParams(\n",
    "        temperature=0.0,\n",
    "        max_tokens=2048,\n",
    "        stop_token_ids=[llm.tokenizer.eos_token_id, 32007],\n",
    "        extra_args={\"steer\": {**base_steer, \"method\": \"add_vector\", \"coefficient\": 10}},\n",
    "    ),\n",
    "]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3dcd47ba",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Next we:\n",
    "1. Apply chat template on each test case,\n",
    "2. Generate all prompts in one batched call with their per-request `SamplingParams`. With activation steering enabled (`use_hook=True`, default), each prompt's hook reads its own `extra_args[\"steer\"]` so different prompts in the same batch use different steer settings,\n",
    "3. Reset the prefix cache to ensure the baseline generation does not reuse steered cache,\n",
    "4. Generate again with `use_hook=False` to obtain the baseline output."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 9,
   "id": "6a7aa04d-b49b-47a7-9edd-1c7beba4c0e4",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stderr",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Rendering prompts: 100%|███████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████| 2/2 [00:00<00:00, 116.32it/s]\n",
      "Processed prompts: 100%|█████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████| 2/2 [00:02<00:00,  1.41s/it, est. speed input: 51.73 toks/s, output: 128.26 toks/s]\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "(EngineCore pid=3981266) Installed 32 steering hooks on layers: ['model.layers.0', 'model.layers.1', 'model.layers.2', 'model.layers.3', 'model.layers.4', 'model.layers.5', 'model.layers.6', 'model.layers.7', 'model.layers.8', 'model.layers.9', 'model.layers.10', 'model.layers.11', 'model.layers.12', 'model.layers.13', 'model.layers.14', 'model.layers.15', 'model.layers.16', 'model.layers.17', 'model.layers.18', 'model.layers.19', 'model.layers.20', 'model.layers.21', 'model.layers.22', 'model.layers.23', 'model.layers.24', 'model.layers.25', 'model.layers.26', 'model.layers.27', 'model.layers.28', 'model.layers.29', 'model.layers.30', 'model.layers.31']\n",
      "(EngineCore pid=3981266) Hooks installed successfully\n",
      "(EngineCore pid=3981266) INFO 06-01 23:12:36 [block_pool.py:472] Successfully reset prefix cache\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stderr",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Rendering prompts: 100%|██████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████| 2/2 [00:00<00:00, 1796.28it/s]\n",
      "Processed prompts: 100%|█████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████| 2/2 [00:02<00:00,  1.04s/it, est. speed input: 70.09 toks/s, output: 156.98 toks/s]\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "examples = [\n",
    "    llm.tokenizer.apply_chat_template(\n",
    "        [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": case}], add_generation_prompt=True, tokenize=False\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    for case in test_cases\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "outputs = llm.generate(examples, sampling_params_list)\n",
    "\n",
    "llm.llm_engine.reset_prefix_cache()\n",
    "\n",
    "outputs_original = llm.generate(examples, sampling_params_list, use_hook=False)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4abda45a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Finally we can print out the results as follows:"
